  user_1,So I just wanted to know if the policy covers pre-existing conditions
  user_2,Ah great question Ananya [typing] Yes it does but there's a waiting period of two years before you can make a claim
  user_1,Okay that sounds good And what about the premium payment Can I pay it monthly
  user_2,[dog barks in the background] Ah sorry about that [clears throat] Yes you can pay it monthly but there's a slight surcharge for that option
  user_1,Okay that's fine I think I can manage that [hold music plays for 30 seconds]
  user_2,[music stops] Sorry about the hold Ananya I just needed to check on something [pause] Yeah so the surcharge is about 5% of the total premium
  user_1,That sounds reasonable And can you please confirm the total premium for my family
  user_2,[typing] Yeah it's around 25,000 per year for a family of three
  user_1,Okay that sounds good And what's the next step to complete the purchase
  user_2,Great [sighs] I just need to send you a link to complete the payment and upload the required documents
  user_1,Okay sounds good Please go ahead and send it to me